1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,330
Ohm's law alone cannot tell you.

2
00:00:02,330 --> 00:00:08,177
The circuit is neither series nor parallel, and the two cells push against each other.

3
00:00:08,177 --> 00:00:11,458
You need two rules that can solve any circuit at all.

4
00:00:11,458 --> 00:00:16,575
They are Kirchhoff's laws, and by the end of part one, you will know every current here.

